o 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, July to August hit 160% of normal on the middle, then November to December fell to 48%. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 36% of normal on the middle, and grid 19406 had its driest year in 2007 at 70%.</p>"}
